Z||000000||Brian84SE||09-06-2000||12:25 PM||||I need a replacement  bushing that goes inside the torque converter.  The bushing itself looks kind of like a camshaft bearing but a little bigger.  I called my local pontiac dealer and he said it wasn't listed separately, I had to get the whole converter.  I asked about the price for a whole converter and he said there wasn't even a listing for that!! Is he full of it?||||reg||1
Z||000001||theogre||09-06-2000||12:38 PM||||Parts for the TC are usually not available. If anyone has them then these people are a good start--&gt; <A HREF="http://www.txchange.com/" TARGET=_blank>Transmission Exchange Co.</A> They should have the whole TC.<P>In all reality if the bearing you can see is worn the other parts of the TC need to be looked at as well.<P>Is this part of a transmission rebuild? Likely if the TC needs any work then the input seal and bearings in the tranny are gone as well.||||reg||1
